  "term": "Miltown",
  "definition": "Miltown is meprobamate, a carbamate-derived drug with calming and sleep-inducing effects. It can reduce anxiety, act as a sedative and anticonvulsant, and has some indirect muscle-relaxing properties by depressing activity at multiple sites in the central nervous system.",
